### CoreStack API - In-Editor Request Collection
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension, JetBrains HTTP Client, or Bruno.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

# Paste your access token here after logging in
@accessToken = your_jwt_access_token_here

# System Endpoints

### 1. Process Liveness Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. PostgreSQL Readiness Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready

### 3. Raw OpenAPI Specification
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json


# Authentication Endpoints

### 4. Register User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "developer@example.com",
  "password": "SuperSecretPassword123!"
}

### 5. Verify Email (Two-Step: Landing Page -> Submission)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "token": "your_verification_token_here"
}

### 6. Resend Verification Email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "developer@example.com"
}

### 7. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "developer@example.com",
  "password": "SuperSecretPassword123!"
}

### 8. Refresh Tokens
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 9. Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 10. Forgot Password (Request Reset Link)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "developer@example.com"
}

### 11. Reset Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "token": "your_password_reset_token_here",
  "password": "BrandNewSecurePassword123!"
}

### 12. Current User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


# Users Management (Admin Role Required)

### 13. List All Users (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users?limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 14. Get User By ID
@targetUserId = your_user_uuid_here
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{targetUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

